# piperidine.msf
# Piperidine (azacyclohexane)
# pKa=11.120 (piperidinium → piperidine, q=+1→0)
# Source: Perrin 1981
# 6-membered saturated N-heterocycle; pKa=11.12 fills the 11-13 gap.
# Contrasts with piperazine (9.73) by having no second N to withdraw
# electron density, demonstrating ring-size and substitution effects.

